{
  "said": "I'm swapping the front brake pads on my Xyber, which means pulling the wheel, cleaning things up, putting new pads in, and getting the caliper back on. I have to do those caliper bolts up firm by feel because there's no manual, and if they back out on the road, I'm going under a car.",
  "used_facts": [
    "what the job is",
    "torque for the caliper bolts"
  ],
  "knew_it": true
}
